cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "driftmatrix: a pre-registered audit of prompt-cache fidelity in llama.cpp under agent traffic"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gamal
    given-names: Manuel
    affiliation: "Ain Shams University"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ManuelGamal/driftmatrix"
abstract: >-
  Measures whether restoring a llama.cpp prompt cache changes the tool calls an LLM agent
  makes, across hybrid recurrent, sliding-window and dense models. Includes the
  pre-registered analysis plan (tag prereg-2026-09-10), the measurement harness, and the
  recorded runs and analysis outputs.
keywords:
  - llama.cpp
  - prompt caching
  - KV cache
  - LLM agents
  - tool calling
  - determinism
  - reproducibility
